        <p class="project-intro-centered">
            A side-by-side comparison showing the transformation from the old interface to the new,
            accessible, and user-friendly design.
        </p>
        <div class="project-grid">
            <div class="wireframe-section">
                <h3 class="before-label">Before</h3>
                <img src="img/projects/apd/before.png"
